<title>SWITZERLAND: Immuno boosts H1 after-tax profit.</title>
<headline>Immuno boosts H1 after-tax profit.</headline>
<dateline>ZOLLIKON, Switzerland 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996:</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> After-tax profit	     38		  vs 23</p>
<p> Group turnover		 350		 vs 341</p>
<p> Operating profit	     49		  vs 56</p>
<p> Pre-tax			  51		  vs 32</p>
<p> Cash flow			65		  vs 47</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Immuno International AG. Baxter International Inc intends to acquire the company over three years in a deal worth around 850 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom 41-1-258 7340</p>
